@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
|Student|
start
:Open the assignment;
:Choose a file and submit;
|System|
if (File type allowed and\nstudent enrolled?) then (no)
  :Show a message;
  stop
endif
if (Before the student's\nown deadline?) then (yes)
  :Save as Submitted\n(new file version);
else (no)
  :Count the late days;
  :Save as Late and show the\nhighest possible mark;
endif
|Lecturer|
:Open the submission and read the file;
:Enter a mark and written feedback;
|System|
:Apply the late penalty\nto get the final mark;
:Set status Marked;
:Write the audit entry;
|HoD|
:Review the marked work\nof the department;
if (Mark needs a change?) then (yes)
  :Change the mark\nand give a reason;
  |System|
  :Save the change and\nwrite the audit entry;
  |HoD|
endif
:Approve the marks;
|System|
:Set status Moderated;
|HoD|
:Confirm the release;
|System|
:Set status Released\nand record the time;
:Notify the students;
|Student|
:View the final mark\nand the feedback;
stop
@enduml
